# Meridian

Read `design.md`, then import from `@/lib/design`. Aesthetic: **cinematic design**.

## Frozen (do not invent)

colorRoles · radii · depths · surfaces · themeKnobs · activity · cinematicLaws · contrastLaws · banned

## Creative (invent freely)

copy · IA · domain objects · frame sequence · which shadcn wholes · narrative inside one-idea frames

## Hard rules

- **OKLCH only** for color tokens — never hex / rgb / hsl
- Soft warm neutrals — never pure white/black or bright neon
- One deep `--brand`; status semantic; theater lifts brand on `data-tone="theater"`
- **Audit contrast** (WCAG AA) on every UI change — `npm run check:contrast`
- No `text-foreground/70` opacity cheats — use `muted-foreground` / `dock-muted`
- Full-bleed media (`BleedImage`) — no inset heroes
- Structured reading (`ReadingArticle` / `reading-prose` / `reading-ui`)
- Compose **shadcn** primitives (`Button`, `Card`, `Badge`, …) into wholes
- Icons from **`@/lib/icons`** (Phosphor, duotone) — never `lucide-react` or direct `@phosphor-icons/react`
- `defineCinemaFrame({ ideas: 1, overlayStickers: false })`
- `data-surface` for density; `svh` never `dvh`; `edge`/`depth-*` never `shadow-*`
- Run `npm run check:design` + `npm run check:contrast` before done

